sequenceDiagram
    participant CM as cycle_manager
    participant BR as opcua_bridge_node
    participant OPC as AssetOpcUaServer
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant AAS as AAS submodels
    participant MQ as Mosquitto
    participant DB as live_dashboard
    CM->>BR: ROS 2 telemetry topics (state, temperature, counts)
    BR->>OPC: write OPC UA nodes
    loop every 1 s
        GW->>OPC: read AssetCell children
        OPC-->>GW: values
        GW->>AAS: write OperationalState
        GW->>GW: compute_oee(uptime, downtime, cycles)
        GW->>AAS: write ConditionMonitoring
        GW->>MQ: publish operational_state and condition_monitoring
    end
    MQ-->>DB: JSON messages
    DB->>DB: append to buffer, redraw plots
